# 🧠 Common Beginner Mistakes

❌ Forgetting the shebang (`#!/bin/bash`).

❌ Not making the script executable (`chmod +x`).

❌ Using incorrect variable syntax.

❌ Running scripts as `root` without need.

❌ Not testing scripts before scheduling them with Cron.

